We sit down at my small table.
It is a bit tight, but we sit close and comfortable.
First, I put the bowls of food on the table.
Afterward, Kasper and Sara take a large portion.
They taste the meatballs and the potatoes.
"This tastes really delicious, Maya!" Sara says.
"Yes, they are really good," Kasper says.
He quickly takes another bite.
Kasper also opens the cold beers.
Then he pours them into our glasses.
"Cheers!" all three of us say and drink.
Kasper takes three more meatballs from the dish.
Sara also takes an extra portion of potatoes.
"I am so glad that you like it," I say.
"There is plenty for everyone," I smile.
They praise the authentic flavor.
We talk and laugh around the table.
We eat and talk for a long time.
